      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "New Madrid was the epicenter of the 1811–12 earthquakes, three intraplate quakes over magnitude 7 that caused river reversals felt as far as New York.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
